<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc1">ESTHER</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc3">Est</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESTHER</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1"/>Alò li te vin rive nan tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:6">Esd 4:6</ref></char></note> Wa Assuréus la, menm Assuréus ki te renye soti Inde jis rive Éthiopie sou san-venn-sèt pwovens yo, <verse eid="EST 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2"/>nan jou sa yo, pandan wa Assuréus te chita sou twòn wayal li a ki te nan sitadèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:1">Né 1:1</ref></char></note> Suse la, <verse eid="EST 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3"/>nan twazyèm ane pouvwa li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:18">Est 2:18</ref></char></note>li te fè yon gran fèt pou tout chèf li yo avèk asistan li yo, chèf lame Perse avèk Mèdes yo, moun prensipal lavil yo, avèk chèf pwovens li yo, tout moun ki te nan prezans li. <verse eid="EST 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4"/>Konsa li te montre tout richès avèk glwa wayal li yo, avèk mayifisans a gran majeste li pandan anpil jou, san-katre-ven jou.<verse eid="EST 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5"/>Lè jou sa yo te fin acheve, wa a te bay yon gwo bankè ki te dire pandan sèt jou pou tout moun ki te prezan nan sitadèl Suse la, soti nan sila ki pi pwisan an jis rive nan sila ki pi piti a, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:7-8">Est 7:7-8</ref></char></note> lakou jaden a palè wa a. <verse eid="EST 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:41">Éz 23:41</ref></char></note> Te gen bagay pann ki fèt an len fen blan e vyolèt ki te kenbe pa kòd fèt an len fen mov, wondèl an ajan avèk pilye an mèb. Devan yo te fèt an lò avèk ajan te plase sou yon pave mozayik ki fèt ak mab wouj, mab blan, gwo pèl klere avèk pyè presye. <verse eid="EST 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7"/>Bwason yo te sèvi nan veso an lò a plizyè kalite, e diven wayal la te anpil, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:18">Est 2:18</ref></char></note> selon bonte a wa a. <verse eid="EST 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8"/>Jan yo te bwè se te selon lalwa, san fòse moun, paske wa a te pase lòd a chak ofisye a chak kay ke li ta dwe fè sa selon dezi a chak moun.<verse eid="EST 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9"/>Anplis, Larenn Vasthi te bay yon bankè pou fanm nan palè ki te pou Wa Assuérus la.<verse eid="EST 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10"/>Nan setyèm jou a, lè kè a wa a te kontan ak diven, li te bay lòd a Mehuman, Biztha, Harbona, Bigtha, Abagtha, Zéthar, avèk Carcas, sèt enik ki te sèvi wa Assuérus, <verse eid="EST 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11"/>pou mennen fè parèt nan prezans li, rèn nan, Vasthi, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:17">Est 2:17</ref></char></note>kouwòn wayal la, pou montre bèlte li a pèp la e a moun pwisan yo, paske li te tèlman bèl. <verse eid="EST 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12"/>Men rèn Vasthi te refize vini sou lòd a wa a, ki te livre pa enik yo. Konsa, wa a te vin byen fache e lakòlè te brile anndan l.<verse eid="EST 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13"/>Alò, wa a te mande a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:7">Jr 10:7</ref></char></note>mesye saj ki te konprann tan yo—paske se te koutim a wa a pou pale devan tout sila ki te konprann lalwa a avèk jistis; <verse eid="EST 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14"/>epi te gen toupre li: Carschena, Schéthar, Admatha, Tarsis, Mérés, Marsena, Memucan, sèt chèf de Perse avèk Médie yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:19">II Wa 25:19</ref></char></note>ki te gen abitid antre nan prezans a wa a, e te chita nan premye plas nan wayòm nan— <verse eid="EST 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15"/>“Selon lalwa a, se kisa ki ta dwe fèt avèk rèn Vasthi, akoz li pa t obeyi lòd a Wa Assuérus ki te livre pa enik yo?”<verse eid="EST 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16"/>Nan prezans a wa a avèk chèf yo, Memucan te di: “Rèn Vasthi te fè tò a wa a, men anplis tout moun nan pwovens a Wa Assuérus yo. <verse eid="EST 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17"/>Paske, si kondwit a rèn nan vin rekonèt a tout fanm yo pou fè yo vin gade mari yo avèk mepriz, epi vin di: ‘Wa Assuérus te kòmande rèn Vasthi pou parèt devan l, men li pa t vini.’ <verse eid="EST 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18"/>Nan jou sa a, fanm a Perse avèk Médie ki te tande afè kondwit rèn nan, va pale tout chèf a wa a nan menm fason an, e va genyen anpil mepriz avèk mekontantman.<verse eid="EST 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19"/>“Si sa fè wa a kontan, kite yon dekrè wayal sòti nan li, e kite li ekri nan lalwa a Perse avèk Médie a, pou l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:8">Est 8:8</ref></char></note>pa kab ranvèse, ke Vasthi p ap kab ankò antre nan prezans a Wa Assuérus la. E konsa, kite wa a bay pozisyon wayal pa li a yon lòt moun ki pi merite l pase li. <verse eid="EST 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20"/>Lè dekrè ke a wa a va fè a tande nan tout wayòm li an, ki tèlman gran, alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Ef 5:22</ref></char></note>tout fanm va gen respè a mari yo, kit gran, kit piti.”<verse eid="EST 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21"/>Pawòl sa a te fè wa a kontan, avèk chèf yo, epi wa a te fè kon Memucan te pwopoze a. <verse eid="EST 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22"/>Konsa, li te voye lèt a tout pwovens a wa yo, a chak pwovens selon ekriti pa li, e a chak pèp selon langaj pa yo, ke tout mesye yo ta dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22-24">Ef 5:22-24</ref></char></note> mèt nan pwòp kay pa yo, e sila te pale nan lang a pwòp pèp li.<verse eid="EST 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:19-20">Est 1:19-20</ref></char></note> lè kòlè a Wa Assuérus te vin kalme, li te sonje Vasthi ak sa li te fè a, e dekrè ki te fèt kont li an. <verse eid="EST 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2"/>Alò, asistan a wa a ki te sèvi li yo, te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:2">I Wa 1:2</ref></char></note>“Annou fè rechèch pou jwenn jenn vyèj ki byen bèl pou wa a. <verse eid="EST 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3"/>Kite wa a apwente sipèvizè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:1-2">Est 1:1-2</ref></char></note> tout pwovens a wayòm li yo pou yo kab rasanble tout bèl vyèj pou vin parèt nan sitadèl Suse la, antre nan kay fanm a wa a ki sou kontwòl Hégué a, enik a wa a, ki an chaj fanm yo. Kite yo byen prepare ak tout bagay pou fè yo bèl yo. <verse eid="EST 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4"/>Alò, kite jenn fi ki bay wa a plezi a, vin regne la nan plas a Vasthi a.” Koze a te fè wa a kontan e se konsa li te fè l.<verse eid="EST 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5"/>Te gen nan sitadèl Suse la, yon Jwif ki te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:2">Est 3:2</ref></char></note> Mardochée, fis a Jaïr, fis a Schimeï, fis a Kis, yon Benjamit, <verse eid="EST 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">II Wa 24:14-15</ref></char></note> ki te ale an egzil soti Jérusalem avèk kaptif ki te ekzile avèk Jeconia yo, wa Juda ke Nebudkanetsar, wa Babylone nan, te fè ekzile a. <verse eid="EST 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7"/>Li t ap elve Hadassa, sa vle di, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:15">Est 2:15</ref></char></note> Esther, fi a tonton li an, paske li pa t gen papa ni manman. Alò, jenn demwazèl la te byen bèl sou fòm ni figi li e lè papa li avèk manman li te mouri, Mardochée te pran li kon pwòp fi pa li.<verse eid="EST 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8"/>Konsa, li te vin rive ke lè kòmand avèk dekrè a wa a te tande e anpil jèn fi te ranmase nan sitadèl Suse la sou sipèvizyon a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:3-15">Est 2:3-15</ref></char></note>Hégaï, ke Esther te pran pou antre nan palè a wa a, anba sipèvizyon a Hégaï, ki te responsab fanm yo. <verse eid="EST 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9"/>Alò, jèn fi a te fè l plezi e te twouve favè devan l. Pou sa, li te bay li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:3-20">Est 2:3-20</ref></char></note> tout atik twalèt avèk manje san fè reta, e li te ba li sèt sèvant de chwa nan palè a wa a, e te voye li avèk sèvant li yo nan pi bon kote pami fanm a wa yo. <verse eid="EST 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:20">Est 2:20</ref></char></note> Esther pa t fè pèsòn konnen ras pèp li a ni fanmi li yo, paske Mardochée te enstwi li pou li pa ta dwe fè sa rekonèt. <verse eid="EST 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11"/>Chak jou, Mardochée te mache ale retou devan lakou fanm a wa yo pou vin aprann jan Esther te ye ak jan afè l t ap mache.<verse eid="EST 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12"/>Alò, lè chans a chak jèn demwazèl te vin rive pou antre kote wa Assuérus la, lè l te fin fè preparasyon douz mwa anba règleman pou fanm yo—paske jou pou konplete preparasyon bèlte yo te fini konsa: si mwa avèk lwil lami a, e si mwa avèk aplikasyon epis ak pafen pou fanm— <verse eid="EST 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13"/>Men kòman jèn fi a ta antre kote wa a: nenpòt bagay ke li te dezire, ta bay a li menm pou pran avè l soti lakay fanm yo pou rive nan palè a wa a. <verse eid="EST 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14"/>Nan aswè, li ta ale ladann e nan maten, li ta retounen nan dezyèm kay fanm yo, sou responsabilite Schaaschgaz, enik a wa a ki te an chaj konkibin a wa yo. Li pa t antre kote wa a ankò sof ke wa a te kontan anpil avèk li e te rele li eksprè pa non l.<verse eid="EST 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15"/>Alò lè lè pou Esther, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:7">Est 2:7</ref></char></note>fi de Abichaïl la, tonton li, Mardochée, ki te pran li kon pwòp pitit pa li, te rive antre kote wa a, li pa t mande anyen sof ke sa ke Hégaï, enik a wa a ki te an chaj fanm yo, te konseye yo. Epi Esther te jwenn favè nan zye a tout moun ki te wè l yo.<verse eid="EST 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16"/>Pou sa, Esther te mennen vè Wa Assuérus nan palè wayal li a nan dezyèm mwa ki nan mwa Tébeth la, nan setyèm ane pouvwa li a. <verse eid="EST 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17"/>Wa a te renmen Esther plis pase tout fanm yo, e li te twouve gras avèk favè devan li menm plis pase tout lòt vyèj yo, jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:11">Est 1:11</ref></char></note>li te mete kouwòn wayal la sou tèt li e te fè li rèn nan plas a Vasthi a.<verse eid="EST 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18"/>Epi wa a te bay yon gran bankè pou tout chèf li yo ak sèvitè li yo. Li te rele l bankè Esther. Li te pwokame l yon jou fèt pou pwovens yo, epi li te bay yo kado <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:7">Est 1:7</ref></char></note> selon jenewozite a wa a.<verse eid="EST 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19"/>Lè vyèj yo te reyini ansanm yon dezyèm fwa a, alò, Mardochée <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:21">Est 2:21</ref></char></note>t ap chita nan pòtay a wa a. <verse eid="EST 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20"/>Esther potko fè yo konnen fanmi li yo, ni pèp li a, jis jan ke Mardochée te bay li lòd fè a, jis jan li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:7">Est 2:7</ref></char></note>lè se te li ki t ap swaye li a. <verse eid="EST 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21"/>Nan jou sa yo, pandan Mardochée te chita nan pòtay palè a wa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:2">Est 6:2</ref></char></note> Bigthan avèk Théresch, de ofisye a wa yo ki t ap veye pòt la, te vin fache, e te chache mete men sou wa Assuérus. <verse eid="EST 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22"/>Men konplo a te vin rekonèt pa Mardochée e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:1-2">Est 6:1-2</ref></char></note> li te pale rèn Esther, e Esther te pale wa a nan non a Mardochée. <verse eid="EST 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23"/>Alò, lè yo fè rechèch nan konplo a e jwenn bout li, yo tou de te pann sou yon bwa; epi sa te ekri nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 10:2">Est 10:2</ref></char></note>Liv Achiv Kwonik Yo nan prezans wa a.<verse eid="EST 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1"/>Apre evènman sa yo, Wa Assuérus te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:11">Est 5:11</ref></char></note>elve pozisyon a Haman, fis a Hammedatha a, Agagit la. Li te pouse l devan e te etabli otorite li sou tout chèf ki te avèk li yo. <verse eid="EST 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2"/>Tout sèvitè a wa yo ki te nan pòtay a wa a te bese ba e te bay onè a Haman; paske, se sa wa a te kòmande pa li menm. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:19">Est 2:19</ref></char></note>Mardochée pa t bese, ni pa t bay onè. <verse eid="EST 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:19">Est 2:19</ref></char></note>sèvitè a wa yo te di a Mardochée: “Poukisa w ap dezobeyi lòd a wa a?” <verse eid="EST 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4"/>Alò, li te rive ke lè yo te pale chak jou avèk li e li te refize koute yo, ke yo te pale Haman pou wè si koz a Mardochée a ta kanpe, paske li te di yo ke se yon Jwif li te ye. <verse eid="EST 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5"/>Lè Haman te wè ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:9">Est 5:9</ref></char></note>Mardochée pa t bese ni ba li onè, Haman te ranpli avèk laraj. <verse eid="EST 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6"/>Men li pa t satisfè pou mete men l sou Mardochée sèl, paske yo te fè l konnen pèp Mardochée a. Konsa, Haman te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:4">Sòm 83:4</ref></char></note>chache detwi tout Jwif yo, pèp Mardochée a, ki te toupatou nan tout wayòm Assuérus la.<verse eid="EST 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7"/>Nan premye mwa ki se mwa Nisan an, nan douzyèm ane Wa Assuérus la, bagay Pur a, sa vle di tiraj osò a, te voye devan Haman jou apre jou e soti mwa apre mwa, jis rive nan douzyèm mwa a, sa vle di, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:15">Esd 6:15</ref></char></note>mwa Adar a. <verse eid="EST 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8"/>Epi Haman te di a Wa Assuérus: “Genyen yon sèten pèp ki gaye toupatou pami pèp la nan tout pwovens nan wayòm ou an; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:12-15">Esd 4:12-15</ref></char></note>lwa pa yo pa menm ak tout lòt pèp nan pwovens a wayòm ou an. Yo menm, yo pa swiv lwa a wa a, e konsa, li pa nan enterè a wa a pou kite yo rete la. <verse eid="EST 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9"/>Si se plezi a wa a, kite yon dekrè pibliye pou yo ta detwi, e mwen va peye di-mil talan ajan nan men a sila ki akonpli afè wa a, pou mete li nan kès a wa a.”<verse eid="EST 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:42">Jen 41:42</ref> </char></note>wa a te retire bag so li nan men l, e te bay li a Haman, fis a Hammedatha a, Agagit la, lènmi a Jwif yo. <verse eid="EST 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11"/>Wa a te di Haman: “Ajan an se pa w, ni pèp la, pou fè avèk yo sa ou pito.”<verse eid="EST 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12"/>Konsa, grefye a wa yo te rele nan trèzyèm jou nan premye mwa a, e li te ekri jan ke Haman te kòmande a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:36">Esd 8:36</ref></char></note>reprezantan a wa a nan tout pwovens yo, a gouvènè ki te sou chak pwovens yo e a chèf a chak pèp, chak pwovens selon ekriti pa li, chak pèp selon langaj pa li, tout sa ekri nan non Wa Assuérus e sele avèk bag so a wa a. <verse eid="EST 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13"/>Lèt yo te voye pa mesaje wa yo nan tout pwovens a wa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:4">Est 7:4</ref></char></note>pou detwi, pou touye e anile tout Jwif yo, ni jèn, ni granmoun, fanm avèk timoun, nan yon sèl jou, nan trèzyèm jou a douzyèm mwa a, ki se mwa Adar a, e pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:11">Est 8:11</ref></char></note>sezi tout byen pa yo kon piyaj. <verse eid="EST 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:13-14">Est 8:13-14</ref></char></note>Yon kopi a dekrè a te dwe sikile kon lwa nan chak pwovens e te pibliye a tout pèp yo pou yo ta prepare pou jou sa a. <verse eid="EST 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15"/>Mesaje wa yo te sòti, ranfòse pa dekrè a wa a, pandan dekrè a te pibliye nan sitadèl Suse la. Wa a avèk Haman te chita ansanm pou bwè, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:15">Est 8:15</ref></char></note>lavil Suse te twouble.<verse eid="EST 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1"/>Lè Mardochée te vin aprann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:8-10">Est 3:8-10</ref></char></note>tout sa ki te fèt yo, li te chire rad li. Li te mete twal sak avèk sann sou li, te ale deyò nan mitan lavil la, e te kriye byen fò anlè avèk amètim. <verse eid="EST 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2"/>Li te rive jis nan pòtay a wa a, paske nanpwen pèsòn ki te abiye an twal sak ki ta kab antre sou pòtay a kay wa a. <verse eid="EST 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3"/>Nan chak pwovens kote lòd la avèk dekrè a wa a te rive, te gen gwo doulè pami Jwif yo, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:16">Est 4:16</ref> </char></note>fè jèn, gwo kriye avèk lamantasyon. Epi anpil te kouche sou twal sak avèk sann.<verse eid="EST 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4"/>Konsa, sèvant a Esther yo avèk enik li yo te vin di li sa, e rèn nan te tòde vire ak gwo lapèn. Konsa, li te voye rad pou abiye Mardochée pou l ta kab retire twal sak la sou li, men li te refize. <verse eid="EST 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5"/>Alò, Esther te voye mande prezans a Hathac soti nan enik a wa yo, pou wa a te chwazi okipe li e te pase l lòd pou parèt kote Mardochée pou mande sa ki t ap pase a, e poukisa? <verse eid="EST 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6"/>Konsa, Hathac te sòti ale kote Mardochée nan plas lavil la devan pòtay a wa a. <verse eid="EST 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7"/>Mardochée te rakonte li tout sa ki te rive li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:9">Est 3:9</ref></char></note>an detay, kantite fòs ajan ke Haman te fè pwomès pou bay nan kès a wa a pou fin detwi tout Jwif yo. <verse eid="EST 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8"/>Anplis, li te bay li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:14">Est 3:14</ref></char></note>yon kopi a dekrè ki te pibliye Suse la pou detwi yo, pou li ta kapab montre Esther pou fè l konnen e bay li lòd pou rive antre kote wa a pou plede pou favè li e plede avè l pou pwoteksyon pèp li a.<verse eid="EST 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9"/>Hathac te retounen e te fè Esther konnen pawòl a Mardochée yo. <verse eid="EST 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10"/>Esther te pale avèk Hathac e te mande li bay repons a Mardochée: <verse eid="EST 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11"/>“Tout sèvitè a wa yo avèk pèp an pwovens a wa yo byen konnen ke si nenpòt gason oswa fanm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:1">Est 5:1</ref></char></note>antre devan wa a nan lakou enteryè a san envite pa li menm, li gen yon sèl lwa; ke li va mete a lanmò, sof ke wa a lonje baton a wa a pou l kab viv. Epi mwen pa t envite kote wa a pandan trant jou sila yo.”<verse eid="EST 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12"/>Yo te pataje pawòl a Esther yo avèk Mardochée. <verse eid="EST 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13"/>Epi Mardochée te di yo reponn a Esther: “Pa imajine ke ou menm nan palè a wa a kab gen chans chape plis ke tout lòt Jwif yo. <verse eid="EST 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14"/>Paske, si ou rete an silans nan moman sa a, sekou avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:42">Lev 26:42</ref></char></note>delivrans va sòti pou Jwif yo soti yon lòt kote, e ou menm avèk lakay papa ou va peri. Kilès ki kab konnen si se pa pou moman sa a ke ou te rive nan pozisyon wayal sila a.”<verse eid="EST 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15"/>Alò, Esther te di yo prepare reponn Mardochée, <verse eid="EST 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16"/>“Ale rasanble tout Jwif ki rete Suse yo e fè jèn pou mwen. Pa manje ni bwè pandan twa jou, ni lannwit, ni lajounen. Mwen avèk sèvant mwen yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:14">Jl 1:14</ref></char></note>fè jèn nan menm jan an. Epi se konsa, mwen va antre kote wa a, ki pa selon lalwa; epi si mwen peri, mwen peri.” <verse eid="EST 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17"/>Konsa, Mardochée te sòti ale fè jis sa ke Esther te bay li lòd fè a.<verse eid="EST 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive nan twazyèm jou ke Esther te mete sou li vètman wayal la, e te kanpe nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:11">Est 4:11</ref></char></note>lakou enteryè a palè wa a devan chanm wa yo, e wa a te chita sou twòn wayal li a nan chanm twòn anfas antre pale a. <verse eid="EST 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2"/>Lè wa a te wè Esther, rèn nan, te kanpe nan lakou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:9">Est 2:9</ref></char></note>li te twouve favè nan zye li. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:11">Est 4:11</ref></char></note>wa a te lonje baton a wa a fèt an lò ki te nan men l lan, vè Esther. Pou sa, Esther te pwoche pre pou te touche pwent an wo baton an.<verse eid="EST 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3"/>Epi wa a te di li: “Se kisa ki twouble ou, rèn Esther? Epi se kisa ke w ap mande? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:2">Est 7:2</ref></char></note>Menm jis mwatye wayòm mwen, li va bay a ou menm.”<verse eid="EST 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4"/>Esther te di: “Si sa fè wa a plezi, ke wa a avèk Haman kapab vini nan menm jou sa a nan yon bankè ke m gen tan prepare pou li.”<verse eid="EST 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5"/>Alò wa a te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:14">Est 6:14</ref></char></note>“Mennen Haman byen vit pou nou kapab fè kon Esther vle a.” Konsa, wa a avèk Haman te vini nan bankè ke Esther te prepare a.<verse eid="EST 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6"/>Pandan yo t ap bwè diven nan bankè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:2">Est 7:2</ref></char></note> wa a te di a Esther: “Se ki petisyon ke ou ap fè a, paske li va bay a ou menm. Kisa menm ou ap mande a? Menm jis mwatye wayòm nan, li va fèt.”<verse eid="EST 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7"/>Konsa, Esther te reponn: “Men petisyon mwen an e sa ke m mande a: <verse eid="EST 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:3">Est 7:3</ref></char></note>Si mwen twouve favè nan zye a wa a, e si sa fè l plezi pou ban mwen petisyon mwen an, e fè sa ke m mande a, ke wa a avèk Haman kapab parèt nan bankè ke m va prepare pou yo a, e demen mwen va fè selon sa ke wa a mande a.”<verse eid="EST 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9"/>Alò, Haman te sòti nan jou sa a byen kontan avèk rejwisans nan kè l, men lè li te wè Mardochée <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:19">Est 2:19</ref></char></note> nan pòtal palè a wa a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:5">Est 3:5</ref></char></note>te wè li pa t leve, ni tranble devan l, konsa, Haman te ranpli avèk laraj kont Mardochée. <verse eid="EST 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10"/>Haman te kontwole tèt li menm malgre sa e te ale lakay li pou te voye chache zanmi li yo avèk madanm li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:13">Est 6:13</ref></char></note> Zérescha. <verse eid="EST 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11"/>Alò, Haman te rakonte yo glwa a richès li, fòs kantite petit li yo, chak moman ke wa a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:1">Est 3:1</ref></char></note> leve li, e te fè l monte pi wo chèf avèk sèvitè a wa a.<verse eid="EST 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12"/>Anplis, Haman te di: “Menm Esther, rèn nan pa t kite lòt moun sof ke mwen menm vini avèk wa a nan bankè ke li te prepare a; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:8">Est 5:8</ref></char></note>demen, ankò, mwen envite pa li menm avèk wa a. <verse eid="EST 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13"/>Malgre tout sa, mwen vin pa kontan chak fwa ke m wè Mardochée, Jwif ki chita nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:9">Est 5:9</ref></char></note>pòtay a wa a.”<verse eid="EST 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14"/>Epi Zéresch, madanm li an, te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:4">Est 6:4</ref></char></note>“Fè yo prepare yon wo etaj senkant koude nan wotè, e demen maten, mande wa a pou pann Mardochée ladann. Epi apre, ale nan bankè a avèk jwa.” Konsèy la te fè Haman byen kontan e li te fè yo prepare etaj la.<verse eid="EST 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1"/>Pandan nwit lan, wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Det 6:16</ref></char></note>pa t kab dòmi. Pou sa, li te pase lòd pou mennen liv achiv kwonik yo pou yo te li li devan wa a. <verse eid="EST 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2"/>Li te twouve ekri ladann sa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:21-22">Est 2:21-22</ref></char></note>Mardochée te rapòte konsènan Bigthan avèk Théresch la, de nan enik wa ki te gadyen pòtay yo, ki te chache pou mete men yo sou wa Assuérus la. <verse eid="EST 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3"/>Wa a te mande: “Ki distenksyon oswa onè yo te bay a Mardochée pou sèvis sa a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:3">Sèvitè a wa yo te di: “Anyen pa t fèt pou li.”<verse eid="EST 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4"/>Pou sa, wa a te di: “Kilès ki nan lakou a?” Alò, Haman te fenk antre nan lakou deyò a palè wa a pou l ta kab pale avèk wa a konsènan afè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:14">Est 5:14</ref></char></note>pann Mardochée sou etaj ki te bati pou li a.<verse eid="EST 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5"/>Sèvitè a wa a te di li: “Men gade byen, Haman kanpe nan lakou a.” Epi wa a te di li: “Kite li antre.” <verse eid="EST 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6"/>Pou sa, Haman te antre anndan e wa a te di li: “Kisa ki ta dwe fèt pou nonm nan<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:7-11">Est 6:7-11</ref></char></note>ke wa a dezire onore a?” Epi Haman te di nan tèt li: “Se kilès wa a ta vle onore plis ke mwen menm nan?” <verse eid="EST 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7"/>Epi Haman te di a wa a: “Pou nonm ke wa a vle onore a, <verse eid="EST 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8"/>kite yo mennen yon vètman wayal ke wa a te konn mete, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:33">I Wa 1:33</ref></char></note>cheval ke wa a te konn monte e sou tèt a sila, yon kouwòn wa a te fin mete. <verse eid="EST 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9"/>Epi, konsa, kite vètman avèk cheval la remèt a youn nan chèf a wa ki pi onore a e kite yo abiye moun ke wa a vle onore a, mennen li sou do cheval la toupatou nan plas lavil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:43">Jen 41:43</ref></char></note>e pwoklame devan li, ‘Se konsa pou l ta fèt a moun nan ke wa a vle onore a.’”<verse eid="EST 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10"/>Epi wa a te di a Haman: “Byen vit pran vètman avèk cheval la kon ou te pale a e fè sa pou Mardochée, Jwif la, ki chita nan pòtay wa a. Pa manke nan anyen a tout sa ke ou te pale yo.”<verse eid="EST 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11"/>Konsa, Haman te pran vètman an avèk cheval la, te abiye Mardochée, te mennen li sou cheval la nan tout plas lavil la, e te fè pwoklamasyon devan l, “Se konsa li va fèt pou nonm ke wa a vle onore a.”<verse eid="EST 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12"/>Konsa, Mardochée te retounen nan pòtay a wa a, men Haman te kouri byen vit pou rive lakay li avèk kri doulè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:30">II Sam 15:30</ref></char></note> ak tèt li kouvri. <verse eid="EST 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13"/>Haman te rakonte a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:10">Est 5:10</ref></char></note>Zéresch, madanm li avèk tout zanmi li yo tout sa ki te rive li yo. Epi mesye saj yo avèk Zéresch, madanm li an, te di li: “Si Mardochée, devan sila ou kòmanse tonbe a, sòti nan Jwif yo, anverite, ou p ap genyen sou li, men anverite, ou va tonbe devan li.” <verse eid="EST 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14"/>Pandan yo t ap toujou pale avèk li, enik a wa yo te rive e byen prese, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:8">Est 5:8</ref></char></note>mennen Haman nan bankè ke Esther te prepare a.<verse eid="EST 6:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1"/>Alò, wa a avèk Haman te vini pou bwè diven an avèk Esther, rèn nan. <verse eid="EST 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2"/>Konsa, wa a te di a Esther ankò nan dezyèm jou a pandan yo t ap bwè diven pa yo nan bankè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:6">Est 5:6</ref></char></note>“Se ki petisyon ou an, rèn Esther? Li va bay a ou menm. Se kisa ke w ap mande a? Menm jis rive mwatye wayòm nan, li va fèt.”<verse eid="EST 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3"/>Rèn Esther te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:8">Est 5:8</ref></char></note>“Si mwen te jwenn favè nan zye ou, O wa, e si se plezi a wa a, ban mwen lavi mwen kon petisyon mwen an, avèk pèp mwen an, se sa ke mwen mande. <verse eid="EST 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:9">Est 3:9</ref></char></note>nou te fin vann mwen menm avèk pèp mwen an, pou nou fin detwi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref></char></note>pou touye e anile nèt. Alò, si se te sèlman ke nou te vann kon esklav, gason kon fanm, mwen ta rete an silans, paske twoub la pa t ap merite ke m ta twouble wa a.”<verse eid="EST 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5"/>Konsa, Wa Assuérus te mande rèn Esther, “Ki moun li ye e kibò li ye, ki ta pwopoze fè afè sila a?”<verse eid="EST 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6"/>Esther te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:10">Est 3:10</ref></char></note>“Yon oprimè avèk yon lènmi, se mechan Haman sila a!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:6">Pou sa a, Haman te vin ranpli avèk laperèz devan wa a avèk rèn nan. <verse eid="EST 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7"/>Wa a nan kòlè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:12">Est 1:12</ref></char></note>te leve kite bwè diven an, e te antre nan jaden palè a. Men Haman te rete pou mande Esther sekou pou lavi li, paske li te wè wa a te vin gen entansyon fè l move bagay. <verse eid="EST 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8"/>Alò, lè wa a te retounen sòti nan jaden palè a pou l antre nan plas kote yo t ap bwè diven an, Haman t ap tonbe sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:6">Est 1:6</ref></char></note>sofa kote Esther te ye a. Konsa, wa a te di: “Èske li va menm vyole rèn nan pandan m la nan kay la?” Depi pawòl la te kite bouch a wa a, yo te kouvri figi a Haman.<verse eid="EST 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9"/>Alò Harbona, youn nan enik yo devan wa a te di: “Gade byen, anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:14">Est 5:14</ref></char></note>men wo etaj senkant koude nan wotè ki kanpe kote kay Haman an, ke li te fè pou Mardochée ki te pale byen pou wa a!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:9">Epi wa a te di: “Pann li sou li!”<verse eid="EST 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:16">Sòm 7:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, yo te pann Haman sou wo etaj ke li te prepare pou Mardochée a e kòlè a wa a te vin bese.<verse eid="EST 7:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1"/>Nan menm jou sa a, Wa Assuérus te bay lakay Haman, lènmi a Jwif yo, a rèn Esther. Mardochée te parèt devan wa a, paske Esther te pale wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:7-15">Est 2:7-15</ref></char></note>sa li te ye pou li. <verse eid="EST 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2"/>Wa a te fin retire bag so ke li te retire nan men a Haman an e te bay li a Mardochée. Konsa, Esther te plase Mardochée sou kay Haman an.<verse eid="EST 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3"/>Esther te pale ankò a wa a, te tonbe nan pye li, te kriye e te sipliye li pou evite mechanste Haman an, Agagit la, avèk konplo ke li te prepare kont Jwif yo. <verse eid="EST 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:11">Est 4:11</ref></char></note>Wa a te lonje baton an lò a vè Esther. Konsa, Esther te leve kanpe devan wa a. <verse eid="EST 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5"/>Li te di: “Si sa fè wa a plezi, si mwen te twouve favè devan li, wa a twouve koz sa a bon, e sa fè kè l kontan pou wè m, kite li ekri pou anile <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref></char></note>lèt ki te manevre pa Haman an, fis a Hammedatha a, Agagit la, ke li te ekri pou detwi Jwif ki nan tout pwovens a wa yo. <verse eid="EST 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6"/>Paske, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:4">Est 7:4</ref></char></note>kijan mwen kab sipòte wè gwo dezas ki va rive pèp mwen an, e kijan mwen kab sipòte wè destriksyon a fanmi mwen yo?”<verse eid="EST 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7"/>Pou sa, Wa Assuérus te pale a rèn Esther e a Mardochée, Jwif la: “Veye byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:1">Est 8:1</ref></char></note>Mwen te bay lakay Haman a Esther e li menm, yo te pann li sou wo etaj la akoz li te lonje men li kont Jwif yo. <verse eid="EST 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8"/>Alò, ou menm ekri a Jwif yo jan ou twouve li bon nan non a wa a, e sele lèt la avèk bag so a wa a; paske, yon dekrè ki ekri nan non a wa a e sele avèk bag so a wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:19">Est 1:19</ref></char></note> p ap kapab anile.”<verse eid="EST 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9"/>Pou sa, grefye a wa yo te rele nan lè sa a nan twazyèm mwa a (sa vle di, mwa Sivan an), nan twazyèm jou a; epi, li te ekri selon tout sa ke Mardochée te kòmande a Jwif yo, reprezantan a wa yo nan pwovens yo, gouvènè yo, avèk chèf a pwovens ki te lonje rive soti nan Inde jis rive Ethiopie, san-venn-sèt pwovens, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:22">Est 1:22</ref></char></note>chak pwovens selon ekriti pa li e a chak pèp selon langaj yo, epi anplis a Jwif yo selon ekriti pa yo, avèk langaj pa yo. <verse eid="EST 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10"/>Li te ekri nan non a Wa Assuérus, te sele li avèk bag so a wa a e te voye lèt yo pa mesaje yo monte sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:28">I Wa 4:28</ref></char></note>cheval ki te nan ras cheval wayal yo. <verse eid="EST 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11"/>Nan lèt sa yo, wa a te bay dwa a Jwif yo nan chak vil, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:2">Est 9:2</ref></char></note>rasanble e fè defans lavi yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref></char></note>pou detwi, pou touye e pou anile tout lame a nenpòt pèp oswa pwovens ki ta vin atake yo, menm ansanm avèk pitit yo ak fanm yo, e piyaje byen yo, <verse eid="EST 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12"/>nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref></char></note>yon sèl jou nan tout pwovens a Wa Assuérus yo, trèzyèm jou nan douzyèm mwa a, (sa vle di, mwa Adar a). <verse eid="EST 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:14">Est 3:14</ref></char></note>Yon kopi a dekrè a te gen pou pibliye kon lwa nan chak pwovens e te pibliye a tout pèp yo, pou Jwif yo ta parèt nan jou sila pou fè revandikasyon yo sou lènmi yo. <verse eid="EST 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14"/>Mesaje yo byen prese, bourade pa lòd a wa a, te sòti monte sou cheval wayal yo. Konsa, dekrè a te distribye nan sitadèl Suse la.<verse eid="EST 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15"/>Epi Mardochée te sòti nan prezans a wa a nan vètman wayal la ki te an koulè ble e blan, avèk yon gran kouwòn an lò ak yon manto fèt an len fen e mov; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:15">Est 3:15</ref></char></note>lavil Suse te fè yon gwo kri avèk jwa, e te rejwi. <verse eid="EST 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 97:11">Sòm 97:11</ref></char></note>Pou Jwif yo, te gen limyè, kè kontan, lajwa avèk lonè. <verse eid="EST 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17"/>Nan chak pwovens nèt ak nan chak vil nenpòt kote lòd a wa a avèk dekrè li te rive a, te gen kè kontan avèk lajwa pou Jwif yo, yon fèt bankè avèk yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:19">Est 9:19</ref></char></note>jou fèt. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:27">Est 9:27</ref> </char></note>anpil moun pami pèp peyi yo te vin Jwif yo, paske krent a Jwif yo te vin tonbe sou yo.<verse eid="EST 8:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1"/>Alò, nan douzyèm mwa a (sa vle di mwa Adar a), sou trèzyèm jou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref></char></note>lè lòd a wa a avèk dekrè li a te prèt pou acheve, nan jou lè lènmi a Jwif yo te gen espwa vin mèt sou yo a, li te vin vire tèt anba jiskaske Jwif yo menm te vin domine sou sila ki te rayi yo. <verse eid="EST 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2"/>Jwif yo te rasanble nan vil pa yo toupatou nan pwovens a Wa Assuérus yo pou mete men yo sou sila ki te chache fè yo mal yo. Konsa, pa t genyen moun ki te kab kanpe devan yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:17">Est 8:17</ref></char></note>paske perèz yo te vin tonbe sou tout moun nan pèp yo. <verse eid="EST 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3"/>Menm tout chèf pwovens yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:36">Esd 8:36</ref></char></note>reprezantan a wa yo, gouvènè yo e sila ki t ap fè afè a wa yo te asiste Jwif yo akoz laperèz a Mardochée te vin tonbe sou yo. <verse eid="EST 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4"/>Anverite, Mardochée te gran lakay a wa a e repitasyon li te gaye toupatou nan pwovens yo, paske nonm nan, Mardouchée, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:1">II Sam 3:1</ref></char></note>te vin pi gwo e pi gwo. <verse eid="EST 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref></char></note> Jwif yo te frape tout lènmi yo avèk nepe, te touye e detwi. Yo te fè sa yo te pito a sila ki te rayi yo. <verse eid="EST 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6"/>Nan sitadèl Suse la, Jwif yo te touye e detwi senk-san òm. <verse eid="EST 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7"/>Yo te touye Parchandatha, Dalphon, Aspatha, <verse eid="EST 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8"/>Poratha, Adalia, Aridatha, <verse eid="EST 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9"/>Parmaschtha, Arizaï, Aridaï avèk Vajezatha, <verse eid="EST 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10"/>dis fis a Haman yo, fis a Hammedatha yo, lènmi a Jwif yo. Men yo te refize touche piyaj la.<verse eid="EST 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11"/>Nan menm jou sa a, fòs kantite a sila ki te touye nan sitadèl Suse la te rapòte a wa a. <verse eid="EST 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12"/>Wa a te di a rèn Esther: “Jwif yo te fin touye e detwi senk-san moun avèk fis a Haman yo nan sitadèl Suse la. Alò, konsa se kisa ke yo gen tan fè nan lòt pwovens a wa yo!” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:6">Est 5:6</ref></char></note>Koulye a, se ki petisyon ou? Menm li menm va bay a ou menm. Epi kisa ou mande anplis? Li menm tou va fèt.<verse eid="EST 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13"/>Epi Esther te di: “Si sa se plezi a wa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:11">Est 8:11</ref></char></note>kite demen, anplis, vin bay a Jwif ki nan Suse yo, pou fè menm ak dekrè ki pou jodi a; epi kite dis fis a Haman yo vin pann sou wo etaj la.”<verse eid="EST 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14"/>Pou sa, wa a te kòmande pou li ta fèt konsa. Yon dekrè te pibliye nan Suse e dis fis a Haman yo te pann. <verse eid="EST 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15"/>Jwif ki te nan Suse yo te rasanble, anplis, nan katòzyèm jou nan mwa Adar a e te touye twa-san moun nan Suse, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:10">Est 9:10</ref></char></note>yo pa t mete men yo sou piyaj la.<verse eid="EST 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16"/>Alò, tout lòt moun nan Jwif yo ki te nan pwovens yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:7-8">Lev 26:7-8</ref></char></note>rasanble pou defann lavi yo, pou te retire lènmi yo pami yo e pou te touye swasann-kenz-mil nan sila ki te rayi yo; men yo pa t mete men yo sou piyaj la. <verse eid="EST 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17"/>Sa te fèt nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:1">Est 9:1</ref></char></note>trèzyèm jou nan mwa Adar e nan katòzyèm jou a, yo te repoze e te fè li yon jou gwo fèt avèk rejwisans.<verse eid="EST 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:11">Est 8:11</ref></char></note>Jwif ki te nan Suse yo te rasanble nan trèzyèm avèk katòzyèm jou nan menm mwa a. Men yo te repoze nan kenzyèm jou a, e te fè li yon jou gwo fèt avèk rejwisans. <verse eid="EST 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19"/>Pou sa, Jwif nan andwa andeyò yo, ki te rete nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:5">Det 3:5</ref></char></note>lavil riral yo, fè katòzyèm jou nan mwa Adar a yon jou fèt pou rejwi, fè fèt ak voye pòsyon manje bay youn lòt.<verse eid="EST 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20"/>Epi Mardochée te fè yon rapò de evènman sila yo, e li te voye lèt a tout Jwif ki te nan tout pwovens a Wa Assuérus yo, ni sila ki pre yo, ni sila ki te lwen yo, <verse eid="EST 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21"/>pou fè yo konprann se devwa yo pou selebre katòzyèm jou a mwa Adar a avèk kenzyèm jou nan menm mwa a chak ane, <verse eid="EST 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22"/>paske nan jou sa yo, Jwif yo retire lènmi yo e se te nan mwa sa a ke tristès la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 30:11">Sòm 30:11</ref></char></note>vin vire an kè kontan e kite rele anmwey la pou rive fè yon jou fèt; ke yo ta dwe fè yo jou a gwo bankè ak rejwisans; epi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:12">Né 8:12</ref></char></note>voye manje bay youn lòt avèk kado pou pòv yo. <verse eid="EST 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23"/>Konsa, Jwif yo te acheve fè sa ke yo te kòmanse fè a e menm sa ke Mardochée te ekri yo. <verse eid="EST 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24"/>Paske Haman, fis a Hammedatha a, Agagit la, advèsè a tout Jwif yo, te manevre kont Jwif yo pou detwi yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:7">Est 3:7</ref></char></note>te voye Pur, sa vle di osò, pou deranje yo ak detwi yo. <verse eid="EST 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25"/>Men lè li te rive nan atansyon a wa a, li te pase lòd pa lèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:6-15">Est 3:6-15</ref></char></note>ke manèv mechan li an pou li te divize kont Jwif yo ta retounen sou pwòp tèt li, e ke li menm avèk fis li yo ta pann sou wo etaj la.<verse eid="EST 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26"/>Pou sa, yo rele jou sila yo Purim menm non ak Pur. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:20">Est 9:20</ref></char></note>akoz enstriksyon nan lèt sila yo, akoz sa yo te wè konsa ak sa ki te rive yo, <verse eid="EST 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:20-21">Est 9:20-21</ref></char></note>Jwif yo te etabli e te fè kon koutim yo avèk desandan yo, pou tout sila ki te fè alyans avèk yo, pou yo pa ta manke selebre de jou sa yo selon règ e selon tan ki apwente chak ane. <verse eid="EST 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28"/>Pou sa, jou sa yo te gen pou sonje e selebre pandan tout jenerasyon, tout fanmi, tout pwovens ak tout vil; epi jou sila yo a Purim pa te janm dwe neglije pami Jwif yo, ni memwa yo vin pèdi fòs pami desandan yo.<verse eid="EST 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29"/>Epi rèn Esther, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:15">Est 2:15</ref></char></note>fi a Abichaïl la, avèk Mardochée, Jwif la, te ekri avèk plen otorite pou konfime dezyèm lèt sa a konsènan Purim. <verse eid="EST 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30"/>Li te voye lèt yo a tout Jwif <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:1">Est 1:1</ref></char></note>nan san-venn-sèt pwovens a wayòm Assuérus yo, avèk pawòl lapè ak verite, <verse eid="EST 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31"/>pou etabli jou a Purim sila yo nan tan ki apwente, jis jan ke Mardochée avèk rèn Esther te etabli a pou yo menm e pou desandan pa yo avèk enstriksyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:3">Est 4:3</ref></char></note>pou tan jèn avèk lamantasyon yo. <verse eid="EST 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32"/>Se te lòd Esther a ki te etabli koutim sila yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:26">Est 9:26</ref></char></note>Purim, e sa te ekri nan liv la.<verse eid="EST 9:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1"/>Alò Wa Assuérus te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:11">És 11:11</ref></char></note>enpoze yon taks sou peyi a avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:11">És 11:11</ref></char></note> peyi kot lanmè yo. <verse eid="EST 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2"/>Epi tout sa li te acheve, otorite li avèk fòs li, ak listwa konplè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:15">Est 8:15</ref></char></note>wotè Mardochée te acheve nan sila wa a te fè l rive a, èske sila yo pa ekri nan Liv A Kwonik A Wa Mèdes Avèk Perse yo? <verse eid="EST 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3"/>Paske Mardochée, Jwif la, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:43-44">Jen 41:43-44</ref> </char></note> sèl dezyèm a Wa Assuérus la, byen gran pami Jwif yo, e byen renmen pa gwo fanmi li, tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:10">Né 2:10</ref> </char></note>yon moun ki te chache sa ki bon pou pèp li, e yon moun ki te pale lapè a tout desandan li yo.<verse eid="EST 10:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10"/>
</usx>
